    # player "So you're asking purely for [emily]'s sake?"
    player "所以你纯粹是为了 [emily] 才问的？"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1412
translate chinese_simp rose_event_16d244a2:

    # rose "Of course."
    rose "当然。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1413
translate chinese_simp rose_event_6b3c1edc:

    # rose "I care about her, and getting involved with someone your age can get messy."
    rose "我关心她，跟年龄差这么多的人交往，容易出问题。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1414
translate chinese_simp rose_event_915934f4:

    # player "Well... By now, you should know I wouldn't do that to her."
    player "嗯……到现在你应该知道我不会那样对她的。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1418
translate chinese_simp rose_event_48f8f16e:

    # rose "Yeah, you're right..."
    rose "嗯，你说得对……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1419
translate chinese_simp rose_event_d975f7b4:

    # rose "But she's the sweetest and most hardworking person I've ever met..."
    rose "但她是我见过最善良、最勤劳的人……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1423
translate chinese_simp rose_event_fa88a7e8:

    # rose "So you can't really blame me for asking."
    rose "所以你也别怪我多问。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1424
translate chinese_simp rose_event_784dfcb3:

    # player "Sure... I do have the same concerns about her..."
    player "嗯……我也对她有同样的担心……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1425
translate chinese_simp rose_event_9cdbfadf:

    # player "That's how all of this started, remember? I wanted to get her away from work, things just escalated from there..."
    player "这就是一切的开端，记得吗？我想让她别只顾着工作，然后事情就慢慢发展到这一步了……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1429
translate chinese_simp rose_event_958e838a:

    # rose "Yeah, yeah... I know..."
    rose "是是是……我知道……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1430
translate chinese_simp rose_event_d2f60301:

    # rose "I also know she's safe in your hands... I just have a bad feeling about something she told me recently..."
    rose "我也知道她在你身边是安全的……只是她最近跟我说的事让我有点不安……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1431
translate chinese_simp rose_event_4d98400b:

    # player "What happened?"
    player "发生什么了？"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1435
translate chinese_simp rose_event_afc8b263:

    # rose "She said some guy's been asking her out and bothering her."
    rose "她说有个男的约她出去，还一直纠缠她。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1436
translate chinese_simp rose_event_36078c51:

    # player "Wait, what? And you thought that was me?"
    player "等等，什么？你以为是说是我？"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1440
translate chinese_simp rose_event_b9214b76:

    # rose "Well who else could it be? All she does is work, and well... housework."
    rose "那还能有谁？她除了工作就是……做家务。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1441
translate chinese_simp rose_event_ac0233be:

    # rose "I thought she was giving me hints to talk to you or something..."
    rose "我以为她是在暗示我来找你谈谈什么的……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1442
translate chinese_simp rose_event_5665364e:

    # player "That wouldn't make much sense, things have been going great with her..."
    player "这说不通啊，我跟她一直处得很好……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1443
translate chinese_simp rose_event_26563300:

    # player "When we're together she looks actually happy, and has no problem showing it."
    player "我们在一起的时候，她看起来真的很开心，而且毫不掩饰。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1447
translate chinese_simp rose_event_9a03d72d:

    # rose "Okay! I don't need to hear about all that."
    rose "好了！这些细节就不用了。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1451
translate chinese_simp rose_event_78d78298:

    # rose "But if it's not someone from home, then it's someone from work."
    rose "不过如果不是家里的人，那应该就是工作上的。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1452
translate chinese_simp rose_event_a1e2c62e:

    # rose "Maybe look into it?"
    rose "你要不要查一下？"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1453
translate chinese_simp rose_event_6bb18d79:

    # player "But why would she not tell me... Or say something..."
    player "可她为什么不告诉我……或者提一下呢……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1457
translate chinese_simp rose_event_b2359594:

    # rose "You really wondering that? It's [emily] we're talking about here..."
    rose "你真不知道为什么？那可是 [emily] 啊……"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1458
translate chinese_simp rose_event_eba78732:

    # rose "She probably wants to deal with it on her own."
    rose "她大概想自己解决吧。"

# game/scripts/house_events.rpy:1459
